; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 28. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'mtA0_intro'
mtA0_intro.dialogstring_07E77E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]A mysterious place[N]extended from Mount[N]Kehres' summit.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]I had never seen so many[N]mushrooms crowded[N]together, or plant stalks[N]tangled together…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0398FC! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]Tried using the mushroom's[N]droplets.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039925! `However, nothing happened![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039935! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]Poured the mushroom's[N]droplets at the place[N]where the stalk ends![END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E4A4! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The creatures of this[N]sanctuary are fierce.[FIN]Let Aura Barrier turn[N]aside what thy blade[N]cannot.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EDF2! `Aura Barrier is a Power of[N]Darkness that is only[N]usable by Freedan, the[N]Warrior of Darkness.[FIN]Thou canst create a[N]barrier composed of thy[N]aura around thee with[N]this power.[FIN]Press Block while[N]holding Attack.`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039861! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1][SFX:10]Tried using the Tearpot.[FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039880! `But nothing happened![END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu92_rofsky'
eu92_rofsky.dialogstring_07D764! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Rofski: Oh, that is[N]definitely the Tearpot[AD] So[N]it really does exist[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu92_erasquez'
eu92_erasquez.dialogstring_07D8D2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Elazquez: The presence of[N]demons is the air in this[N]town…[FIN]I feel that demons have[N]switched places with some[N]of the townspeople.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]It might be people[N]travelling through the[N]plaza, it might be your[N]friend, it might be me.[FIN]You should try to use the[N]Tearpot on characters that[N]you think are suspicious.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039890! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]The tears of the gods[N]showered down![END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu95_neils_father'
eu95_neils_father.dialogstring_07E259! `[BOR:8][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]Race of the Moon:[N]Mweheheheheheheh…[FIN]Darkness will soon envelop[N]this world, too.[FIN][CLD][BOR:8][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1A]The owners of the bodies[N]we were just using have[N]become bones sleeping in[N]the basement of the[N]chapel.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu95_neil'
eu95_neil.dialogstring_07E3F4! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: [AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I came home after three[N]years[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]and thought I'd[N]finally understood how[N]much my parents meant to[N]me.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Now I don't even know how[N]long they've been gone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Will[AD] Would you mind[N]leaving me alone for a[N]while?[FIN][CLD][DEF]Neil lowers his head.[N]Will has never seen him[N]like this before.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_neil'
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DC37! `[DEF]The next morning brings[N]unwelcome news[AD][END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DC63! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Good morning. I[N]guess I've caused everyone[N]to worry…[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I've been thinking about[N]it all night, but in the[N]end I feel like this[N]company can't continue[N]unless I inherit it.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I want to do something to[N]stop the slave trade;[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I was thinking that the[N]company that first[N]established that slave[N]trade should work towards[N]abolishing it…[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]I guess there's no way[N]around exchanging human[N]misery for money.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: So, that must mean[N]Neil's going to become the[N]president of the company?[N]Cooooool!![FIN][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hehe. I'm feeling[N]kind of embarrassed for[N]some reason.[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DD70! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Oh, and Kara-[N]someone came to see you.[FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]You've mentioned your old[N]sweetheart before.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Huh[AD]!?[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DDBF! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hey, come in…![END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DDD2! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hamlet[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Squee squee[AD]![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]How?! Is he alright?![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Hahaha. Apparently[N]he followed you all this[N]way.[WAI][N]Lilly found her in[N]Watermia and sent word to[N]us.[WAI][N]Reuleck has couriers[N]almost everywhere,[N]so I had her brought[N]safely here.[WAI][N]I may be leaving the[N]road, but it looks[N]like your party keeps[N]gaining allies.[END]`
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DEAD! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Take care, everyone.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_erik'
eu96_erik.dialogstring_07DB09! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I don't understand[N]girls at all.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_neil'
eu96_neil.dialogstring_07DEF9! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1]Squee squee...[END]`

?INCLUDE 'eu96_kara'
eu96_kara.dialogstring_07DA3D! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: It seems that if we[N]head to the west of here,[N]we'd reach the ruins of[N]Angkor Wat.[FIN]It seems that the native[N]land of the slaves is in[N]exactly that same place.[FIN]Alright, let's go check[N]it out![END]`
